  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen you press Go Home in your Quick Menu the pop-up with Yes, Default and No will appear. The yes Button in terms of it's position is directly above the Go Home Button on the Launch Pad which means you should just be able to press double click to go to your Home world, this doesn't work though. You first need to move your cursor away from the Yes button and then back on to it to be able to press it.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/wjfcc8",
